				<div class="leftcol game_description_column"  data-panel="{&quot;flow-children&quot;:&quot;column&quot;}" >

					
												<div id="earlyAccessHeader" class="early_access_header">
		<div class="heading">
												<h2 class="inset">Early Access Game</h2>
					<p class="inset subtitle">Get instant access and start playing; get involved with this game as it develops.</p>
				
				<p><span>Note:</span> Games in Early Access are not complete and may or may not change further. If you are not excited to play this game in its current state, then you
									should wait to see if the game progresses further in development. <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/earlyaccessfaq/?snr=1_5_9_">Learn more</a></p>
					</div>
				<div id="earlyAccessBody" class="devnotes">
							<div class="devs_say">What the developers have to say:</div>
			
			<div id="devnotes_expander">
									<h3>Why Early Access?</h3>
					“We chose Early Access to involve the community in shaping Groundwork Simulator before its full release. The gameplay foundation is fully in place, and we plan to expand the experience with more maps and vehicles while using player feedback to guide additional features and improvements.”
					<h3>Approximately how long will this game be in Early Access?</h3>
					“Groundwork Simulator is expected to remain in Early Access for approximately 3–6 months. This timeframe may change depending on development progress and community feedback. Progress updates will be shared throughout Early Access.”
					<h3>How is the full version planned to differ from the Early Access version?</h3>
					“We plan to expand the game with an additional map, more vehicles and new weather features, alongside improvements to existing systems, usability, MOD SUPPORT and performance. Community feedback will help guide further additions and development priorities. These plans may evolve during Early Access.”
					<h3>What is the current state of the Early Access version?</h3>
					“The Early Access version includes most of the features planned for the full release, one playable map, a range of vehicles and heavy machinery, and a story mode that introduces players to the game’s core mechanics through a guided tutorial.”
					<h3>Will the game be priced differently during and after Early Access?</h3>
					“There are no plans to change the base price when Groundwork Simulator leaves Early Access.”
					<h3>How are you planning on involving the Community in your development process?</h3>
					“The Steam Community discussions and the official Discord server will serve as places for feedback, bug reports and feature suggestions. Player experiences will help identify areas for improvement and features that could enrich the groundwork and mining experience. Community input will help guide development priorities, with progress and changes communicated through development updates.”
							</div> <!-- /devnotes_expander -->
			<a class="morebutton" id="devnotes_more" href="#"  onclick="$J('#devnotes_expander').css({'max-height': 'none'}); $J(this).hide(); return false;">Read more</a>
		</div>
	</div>
										
					
