								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<h2 class="bb_tag" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5306540/extras/6d2c0c16e1f545d26a993f6237ce55cc.poster.avif?t=1793005696" aria-label="A wheel loader operates beside a wash plant and conveyors in a forest clearing." width=1170 height=366 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5306540/extras/6d2c0c16e1f545d26a993f6237ce55cc.webm?t=1793005696" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5306540/extras/6d2c0c16e1f545d26a993f6237ce55cc.mp4?t=1793005696" type="video/mp4"></video></span><strong>WELCOME TO GROUNDWORK SIMULATOR</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Groundwork Simulator puts you behind the controls of heavy machinery, with a landscape to reshape and gold to uncover. Dig into the hillside, haul material across your site and set up the equipment that turns a bucket of dirt into your next gold recovery. Work at your own pace or share the job with friends.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >EVERY BUCKET CHANGES THE LANDSCAPE</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Dig trenches, cut into hillsides and build up piles as you shape your worksite. Every scoop changes the ground you work on, creating new routes, steeper slopes and fresh challenges. Plan your approach, the ground you leave behind becomes the foundation for your next job.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5306540/extras/6d2c0c16e1f545d26a993f6237ce55cc.poster.avif?t=1793005696" aria-label="A wheel loader operates beside a wash plant and conveyors in a forest clearing." width=1170 height=366 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5306540/extras/6d2c0c16e1f545d26a993f6237ce55cc.webm?t=1793005696" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5306540/extras/6d2c0c16e1f545d26a993f6237ce55cc.mp4?t=1793005696" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >REALISTIC PHYSICS</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Dig with a realistic excavation engine and simulated hydraulic feedback that brings resistance to every scoop. Feel your machine respond as the bucket meets the ground and material builds up inside it. Adjust your angle and work with the available hydraulic power to cut through the terrain, fill your bucket and lift the load.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5306540/extras/b56c0f61583939ca95b3391f194d7b1f.poster.avif?t=1793005696" aria-label="An excavator scoops soil from a hillside, reshaping the ground with its bucket." width=1170 height=366 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5306540/extras/b56c0f61583939ca95b3391f194d7b1f.webm?t=1793005696" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5306540/extras/b56c0f61583939ca95b3391f194d7b1f.mp4?t=1793005696" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >FROM DIRT TO GOLD</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Explore the land in search of gold-rich ground. Drill and test for deposits, choose your digging spot and set up your wash plant. Excavate promising material, wash it through the sluice boxes and process the concentrate on the shaking table, from your first test hole to your next gold recovery.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5306540/extras/6073c731b013d93419e71f6b642bc4e6.poster.avif?t=1793005696" aria-label="A truck-mounted drilling rig explores the ground at a forest mining site." width=1170 height=366 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5306540/extras/6073c731b013d93419e71f6b642bc4e6.webm?t=1793005696" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5306540/extras/6073c731b013d93419e71f6b642bc4e6.mp4?t=1793005696" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >WORK SOLO OR SHARE THE SITE</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Run the operation yourself or divide the work in online co-op. Take the excavator while a friend handles transport, or keep material moving together between the digging area and the wash plant. Coordinate your machines and turn a patch of untouched ground into a busy worksite.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5306540/extras/30eb0373354dd5cb58891f33a5782fcd.poster.avif?t=1793005696" aria-label="Excavators, trucks and a wheel loader work around an illuminated wash plant at night." width=1170 height=366 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5306540/extras/30eb0373354dd5cb58891f33a5782fcd.webm?t=1793005696" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5306540/extras/30eb0373354dd5cb58891f33a5782fcd.mp4?t=1793005696" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >WATER SYSTEM</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Bring water to your washing operation with pumps and hoses. Position your equipment, route your connections across the site and get water flowing where it’s needed. As your worksite grows, adapt your setup to keep the washing operation supplied.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5306540/extras/74396d7fcf8445b74617a92d7719523c.poster.avif?t=1793005696" aria-label="View from an excavator cabin as its bucket digs beside flowing water." width=1170 height=366 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5306540/extras/74396d7fcf8445b74617a92d7719523c.webm?t=1793005696" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5306540/extras/74396d7fcf8445b74617a92d7719523c.mp4?t=1793005696" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >TRANSPORT</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Load your heavy machinery onto a trailer and haul it by truck to your next worksite. Line up for loading, plan your route and navigate tight turns, slopes and rough terrain with a heavy load behind you. Unload your equipment where you need it and get to work.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5306540/extras/35628e09383f1b11a50bd0cf42b7d28f.poster.avif?t=1793005696" aria-label="A heavy truck transports a bulldozer on a low-loader trailer along a forest road." width=1170 height=366 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5306540/extras/35628e09383f1b11a50bd0cf42b7d28f.webm?t=1793005696" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5306540/extras/35628e09383f1b11a50bd0cf42b7d28f.mp4?t=1793005696" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >FIGHT THE TERRAIN</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Mud, slopes and rough ground make every route a decision. Watch your traction, choose your approach and take care with a heavy load. Sometimes the next job is improving the ground beneath your wheels before you can get back to digging.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5306540/extras/a9838df703c1e23ad1be7013d9c82e69.poster.avif?t=1793005696" aria-label="A wheel loader operates beside a wash plant and conveyors in a forest clearing." width=1170 height=366 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5306540/extras/a9838df703c1e23ad1be7013d9c82e69.webm?t=1793005696" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5306540/extras/a9838df703c1e23ad1be7013d9c82e69.mp4?t=1793005696" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p>						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse">
		<div id="game_area_content_descriptors" class="game_area_description">
			<h2>AI Generated Content Disclosure</h2>
			<p>The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
					Generative AI tools were used to assist with some assets.				</i>
			</p>
					</div>
	</div>
	
				
				
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse sys_req" style="max-height: 300px;">
		<h2>System Requirements</h2>
					<div class="sysreq_tabs">
									<div class="sysreq_tab active" data-os="win">
						Windows					</div>
									<div class="sysreq_tab " data-os="mac">
						macOS					</div>
								<div style="clear: left;"></div>
			</div>
				<div class="sysreq_contents">
							<div class="game_area_sys_req sysreq_content active" data-os="win">
											<div class="game_area_sys_req_leftCol">
							<ul>
								<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class="bb_ul"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1070 — 8 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Groundwork Simulator’s detailed soil and water physics place a heavy load on the CPU. These complex simulations make the game demanding, even if its visuals may suggest otherwise.</li></ul>							</ul>
						</div>
																<div class="game_area_sys_req_rightCol">
							<ul>
								<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class="bb_ul"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-12400 / AMD Ryzen 5 5600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 24 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 3060 — 8 GB / AMD RX 6600 — 8 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>							</ul>
						</div>
